  m_Name: Forest_AiraDiary_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Forest_AiraDiary_2
  headerName: "Aira's Diary \u2014 Entry 2"
  content: "\tI've come a long way now. Traveling this far alone is harder than I
    expected \u2014 especially when the forest itself no longer behaves like a forest.
    But at least there are no mutant creatures or shambling undead. This isn't one
    of those films. If it were, I'd already be dead.\n\r\n\tI wonder how Tawan is.\r\n"
